Triangle read by rows, based on the morphism f: 1->2, 2->3, 3->4, 4->5, 5->{5,9,7,6}, 6->7, 7->8, 8->9, 9->10, 10->{10,4,2,1}. First row is 1. If current row is a,b,c,..., then the next row is a,b,c,...,f(a),f(b),f(c),...

The 105 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

